From c7ef4691571cc462815816c098fa9d241bc58c81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zephyrstudiosllc <zschwendi@zephyrstudios.dev>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 11:05:43 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(arm64): add typed data-arena method invoker
 (AI-assisted)

Add a minimal Apple ARM64 microtarget that invokes trusted arity-one native bindings with distinct process, symbol-table, and arena registers. Exercise the real generated Jak 1 reset entry through the production boundary without interpreting GOAL method words as code pointers.
